# Raw pulled corpus is committed (not ignored) — the Streamlit Community
# Cloud deploy needs it present in the repo, since the deployed filesystem
# has nothing outside git and can't practically run live ingestion on
# every cold start. Regenerate via `python -m app.core.ingestion` for a
# fresher pull; re-commit if you want the deployed app to reflect it.

